      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Within the last four years, more than 500 chest pain centers have developed in response to new paradigms for early heart attack care. These shifting paradigms now focus on acute prevention, in terms of both early thrombolytic therapy and cardioprotection of patients with prodromal symptoms of a heart attack."},
